Error [jet.ToolProviderUnavailable]: Tool provider `npm` isn't available yet
 Why: The package shell spans built-in providers, but `…@npm` has no hangar realization path yet (JPK-TOOL-PROVIDER). Built-in providers that work today: nixpkgs, github, and bare local paths.
 Fix: Use a built-in ref (`…@nixpkgs`, `…@github`, or a bare local path), or wait for the `npm` provider to land.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E1298
